# The build context is the repository root, but serve/Dockerfile only ever
# copies serve/*.go, serve/go.mod and web/. Everything listed here is kept out
# so that editing it neither slows the context upload nor invalidates a build
# cache layer that does not depend on it.

.git
.github
.claude

node_modules
src-tauri
test
e2e
docs

# Runtime, not source: drafts, event state and the throwaway checkouts.
drafts
state
worktrees
clones
logs

*.md

# Except the install document, which the site hands out rather than writes
# about. The marketing image copies it out of this one; excluded, that is a 404.
!install.md

# The skills are the install document's sources rather than a second copy to
# ship, and the generator builds the document rather than being part of it.
skills
